# Design source assets. The 1024x1536 product renders are ~1.4MB each and the
# Helvetica Neue family another 8MB -- 15MB of originals that would sit in
# every clone of a Raspberry Pi project forever. What the dashboard actually
# serves is checked in: cashier_dashboard/public/img/products/*.webp, 214KB for
# the set, re-encoded from these. Keep the originals somewhere shared instead.
Sabon UI resources/
drive-download-*/
drive-download-*.zip
